ScRAT phenotype MCP package
===========================

Paper: Mao et al., "Phenotype prediction from single-cell RNA-seq data using
attention-based neural networks", Bioinformatics 40(2), btae067 (2024),
doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btae067.

Reference implementation: https://github.com/yuzhenmao/ScRAT
Reference commit: cbf07723233e2bac0a62be667dbda29a7afe06cd

This package is an independent implementation of the equations and workflow
published in the paper. No files from the reference repository are redistributed
here. The reference repository contains no license file at the pinned commit;
this NOTICE does not assert rights to redistribute that repository's code.

The new package source is distributed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.
